  "live_records": {
    "q-109777": {
      "dom_id": "step-q109777",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Which of the following subspaces must be orthogonal to $\\text{Col}(A)$ for every matrix $A?$\n\nI. $\\text{Col}({A}^{T})$\n\nII. $\\text{Null}({A}^{T})$\n\nIII. $\\text{Null}(A)$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that $\\text{Col}(A)$ consists of all linear combinations of the columns of $A$, that is, the rows of ${A}^{T}.$\n\nIf a vector is orthogonal to every linear combination of the rows of ${A}^{T},$ it must be orthogonal to each row of ${A}^{T}.$\nBut notice that when pre-multiplying a vector by ${A}^{T},$ we actually multiply each row of ${A}^{T}$ by that vector.\nSo, $\\text{Col}(A)$ must be orthogonal to the left null space of $A,$ which is $\\text{Null}({A}^{T}).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"\n\n**Note:** In general, the four fundamental subspaces of a matrix $A$ can be schematically visualized, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14154359/assets/de22dd5b352e1d5be48f4b6ed3b2a4657ae623c1bd288d3464559758ea334af7.png)",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-109777-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "III only",
              "html": "III only"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-109777-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and III only",
              "html": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-109777-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I only",
              "html": "I only"
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-109777-d",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II only",
              "html": "II only"
            },
            {
              "option": "e",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-109777-e",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II and III only",
              "html": "II and III only"
            }
