    "q-109872": {
      "dom_id": "step-q109872",
      "name": "Question 11",
      "problem": "Consider a $7\\times 8$ matrix $A.$ If $\\text{dim}(\\text{Col}(A))=4,$ then $\\text{dim}(\\text{Null}(A))=$",
      "worked_solution": "The four fundamental subspaces of a matrix $A$ can be schematically visualized, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14154359/assets/889b83fadd26b377c4dd34143c9b16541630c04e90de3d9b005e7147ead75ad5.png)\n\nIn our case, we are given that $m=7,$ $n=8,$ and $r=4.$ \n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{dim}(\\text{Null}(A)) & =n-r=8-4=4.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
